sequenceDiagram
    participant S as SAP S/4HANA
    participant I as Integration Service
    participant V as Validator/Transformer
    participant K as Kafka
    participant F as FinSight API
    participant R as Reconciliation
    S->>I: Extract delta (approved provider)
    I->>V: Canonical source records
    V->>V: Validate, map, enrich
    V->>K: Publish domain events
    K->>F: Idempotent upsert
    F-->>K: Accepted/rejected result
    K->>R: Batch results + source totals
    R->>R: Count and financial checks
    R-->>I: Reconciliation status / checkpoint decision
